<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's H1 retail volume drops 5.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary's H1 retail volume drops 5.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of Hungary's retail sales dropped 5.9 percent in the first half  from a year ago, while catering sales volume rose 8.1 percent, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY RETAIL TRADE AND CATERING VOLUME (Yr/yr pct change)</p>
<p>		June 97  May 97  June 96  Jan-June 97  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Retail   +0.9     -2.4    -2.4	-5.9	   -4.9</p>
<p>    Catering +8.8     +4.8    -2.2	+8.1	   -8.9</p>
<p>HUNGARY RETAIL TRADE AND CATERING TURNOVER (Forint blns)</p>
<p>		June 97  May 97   June 96 Jan-June 97  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Retail   245.6   239.4     211.5    1,280.9     1,167.8</p>
<p>    Catering  21.0    20.8	16.5	110.7	  86.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Inflation ran at 18.7 percent in June.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
